      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Yeh chapter buniyadi computational structures, yaani lists, stacks, queues, trees aur graphs, ka mukammal jaiza deta hai. Is mein in ki properties, operations aur istemal bayan hue, aur yeh bataya gaya ke data ko tarteeb dene aur sambhalne mein in ka kya kirdar hai. Chapter yeh bhi batata hai ke masle ki zaroorat ke mutabiq sahi data structure kaise chunein, aur pecheeda masail hal karne ke liye mukhtalif structures ko kaise milayein. Maqsad yeh hai ke parhne wala in structures ko mukhtalif computing ke kaamon mein achhi tarah istemal kar sake."
          },
